        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset PSKSQT, Modern Pismo Knob with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pismo Knob with Square Rosette has a modern look that is emphasized through the use of clean lines and a square shaped rose. This knobset is best used in residential settings. The keyed entry function features Kwikset's SmartKey. The Modern Pismo Knob with Square Rose is also available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for every interior door in your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Pismo Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Pismo Square Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-6/7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pismo Knob with Square Rosette",
                "description": "The Pismo Knob with Square Rosette has a modern look that is emphasized thorough the use of clean lines and a square shaped rose. This knobset is best used in residential settings. The keyed entry function features Kwikset's SmartKey. The Modern Pismo Knob with Square Rose is also available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for every interior door in your home.",
